g abnormality or chronic treatment with medications that directly affect gastrointestinal motility.\n* History of suicide attempt.\n* History of significant active or unstable Major Depressive Disorder (MDD) or other severe psychiatric disorder.\n* Received treatment with semaglutide, tirzepatide, glucagon-like peptide-1 receptor (GLP-1R) agonist, GLP-1/glucose-dependent insulinotropic polypeptide (GIP), or glucagon receptor agonist within 3 months prior to Screening.\n\nNote: Additional inclusion/exclusion criteria may apply, per protocol.","healthy_volunteers":false,"maximum_age":null,"minimum_age":"18 Years","sex":"ALL","std_ages":["ADULT","OLDER_ADULT"]},"enrollment":{"count":1270,"type":"ACTUAL"},"first_posted":"2025-12-16","has_results":false,"interventions":[{"name":"Ribupatide","other_names":["KAI-9531"],"type":"DRUG"},{"name":"Semaglutide","other_names":["Wegovy"],"type":"DRUG"},{"name":"Placebo","other_names":[],"type":"DRUG"}],"last_known_status":null,"last_update_posted":"2026-10-06","lead_sponsor":{"class":"INDUSTRY","name":"Kailera"},"nct_id":"NCT07284979","official_title":"A Phase 3, Randomized, Active- and Placebo-Controlled, Partially-Blinded Study to Compare the Efficacy and Safety of KAI-9531 Administered Once Weekly Versus Semaglutide and Placebo in Participants Living With Obesity Who Do Not Have Diabetes","overall_status":"ACTIVE_NOT_RECRUITING","phases":["PHASE3"],"primary_completion_date":{"date":"2028-03","type":"ESTIMATED"},"primary_outcomes":[{"measure":"Percent Change From Baseline in Body Weight at Week 76","time_frame":"Baseline, Week 76"}],"results_first_posted":null,"sites":[{"city":"Bruce","country":"Australia","facility":"Kailera Clinical Site","lat":-35.24405,"lon":149.09083,"state":"Australian Capital Territory","status":null},{"city":"Blacktown","country":"Australia","facility":"Kailera Clinical Site","lat":-33.76667,"lon":150.91667,"state":"New South Wales","status":null},{"city":"Kanwal","country":"Australia","facility":"Kailer